  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Mosiah",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 8,
    "summary": "Ammon teaches the people of Limhi—He learns of the twenty-four Jaredite plates—Ancient records can be translated by seers—No gift is greater than seership. About 121 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that after king Limhi had made an end of speaking to his people, for he spake many things unto them and only a few of them have I written in this book, he told his people all the things concerning their brethren who were in the land of Zarahemla.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 61,
            "end": 69,
